# Guarded Heir: "When this creature enters, create two 3/3 white Knight creature tokens." Bot1 casts it on turn 1 for {5}{W}
# (Black Lotus for white and three Moxen) and, once the Heir and then its enters trigger have resolved, controls the Heir and
# two Knight tokens: 3/3 white Knight creatures that are tokens, with no abilities. The trigger waits on the stack until
# then (a positive control that the tokens come from the trigger and not from the spell). Bot2 gets nothing (CR 111.2).

[Bot1 Deck]
Guarded Heir
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Island x20

[Actions]
